  "text": "Stop typing the same email replies, links, and code snippets over and over. Customer support reps and developers retype identical onboarding responses dozens of times throughout the workday. Copying templates from notes apps breaks focus and introduces embarrassing copy-paste typos into client messages. Espanso solves this by detecting custom keyboard triggers system-wide and instantly replacing them with dynamic snippets. You shave hours off repetitive typing across every application.",
